y and creaks, the wild grass keeps getting slammed flat and snapping back as each new gust hits, and the willow trunks keep slamming sideways and bending again as the gale keeps battering. From the sixth second through the ninth second, the wind reaches peak violence and still shows no sign of letting up: a blue plastic bag blasts low acrossd grass, and a thick cloud of grassrolls across the fallow field almost hiding the distant Jiangnan village rooftops. Throughout the entire nine seconds, the wind never stops battering, the wild grass never stops getting slammed flat, the leaves never stop blasting past, and the dense black low cloud stays pressed down covering the entire sky; continuous faint lightning flickers deep inside the heavy clouds overhead, pale flashes pulsing throughout the storm clouds without stopping. Shot on a 16mm fisheye ultra-wide lens in subjective POV.\n\noverall_soundscape: From the start through the third second, a brutal gale slams the wild grass flat without pause and starts blasting yellow leaves past the frame; from the third through the sixth second, the wind never lets up, with leaves, willow leaves, dried grass bits and twigs blasting sideways in an unbroken stream, the metal sign clatters, the solar streetlight creaks; from the sixth second on, the wind reaches peak violence with no sign of weakening, a plastic bag\ntumbles low and grass debris rollsd.\n\nnon_diegetic_music: N/A"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "value"}], "flags": {}, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "title": "输入提示词", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [588.4296875, 687.9844970703125], "pos": [1078.4219970703125, 748.5248413085938], "id": 29, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 11}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "FLOAT", "links": [15], "label": "FLOAT", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "FLOAT"}], "size": [270